    "claim": "Scene 1c45ce3a is confirmed as a failing case with the car 1.0 s earlier, at 0.75x speed and ego at 0.8x: every run failed. The crash was always with actor 24 coming from behind on the right, never with the retimed lead car 14. Twice the replayed actor 24 merged into the ego, which had fallen about 18 m behind the recorded drive (fault unclear). Once the ego drifted right into it (policy at fault). So this case may partly be an effect of replay traffic not reacting to the ego.",
